Furthermore, each edge vector~$\vect(u_i,w_j)$ has value~1 in all important dimensions with respect to~$(u_i,j)$ and~$(w_j,i)$.
Hence, after the vertex vectors corresponding to a multicolored clique~$C$ are moved out of the target bin~$B^*$ the edge vectors corresponding to~$C$ can be moved into those empty positions in the target bin~$B^*$.
